cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Tissue-specific transcriptomics of Pleurotus ostreatus mycoponic mycelium: reanalysis pipeline and metabolic reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  Reanalysis of 16 3'-end tag RNA-seq libraries from four mycelial tissue types of
  Pleurotus ostreatus cv. "Harbor Blue P01" grown in a mycoponic ceramic-tube system.
  Includes an empirically selected reference genome, a 3'-aware and rRNA-complete
  annotation, differential expression following NASA GeneLab GL-DPPD-7101-G, WGCNA
  co-expression modules, and a draft genome-scale metabolic reconstruction.
